    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA stunning dual-aspect penthouse residence commanding breathtaking panoramic views of Phoenix Park and IMMA from an enviable sixth-floor position in the heart of Dublin 8.\n\nOccupying a prime sixth-floor penthouse position within the highly regarded Heuston South Quarter development, No. 28 The Telford is an exceptional two-bedroom apartment commanding spectacular dual-aspect views across some of Dublin's most iconic landmarks. This beautifully presented residence enjoys uninterrupted vistas towards the expansive greenery of the Phoenix Park to one side, while the other overlooks the striking grounds and historic setting of the Irish Museum of Modern Art (IMMA).\n\nFlooded with natural light through its impressive dual-aspect orientation, the accommodation extends to a generously proportioned layout designed for modern living. The apartment combines stylish contemporary interiors with well-balanced living and bedroom accommodation, creating an elegant and welcoming atmosphere throughout. The spacious open-plan living and dining area provides an ideal space for both everyday living and entertaining, while the elevated penthouse position offers a wonderful sense of privacy above the city.\n\nPerfectly positioned in one of Dublin's most vibrant and well-connected neighbourhoods, residents benefit from immediate access to Heuston Station, the LUAS, Phoenix Park and a host of excellent amenities, cafés, restaurants and cultural attractions, all within walking distance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Exceptional sixth-floor penthouse apartment</li><li>Spectacular dual-aspect views</li><li>Overlooking Phoenix Park and IMMA</li><li>Bright and spacious accommodation</li><li>Highly sought-after Dublin 8 location</li><li>Excellent transport links nearby</li><li>Walking distance of Phoenix Park</li><li>Located minutes away from Heuston Station</li><li>A secure underground car parking space is included</li><li>Concierge office with shared working space</ul>"
      },
